==English==
===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}
#{{biology}} [[Wedge]]-[[shaped]].
#{{botany}} Wedge-shaped, with the [[narrow]] part at the [[base]].
#{{botany}} Having [[straight]], or almost straight sides meeting at the [[apex]] or base.

====Usage notes====
A [[deltoid]] leaf is roughly triangular in shape, but may have much less obvious "angles". An [[obdeltoid]] leaf is practically the same, except that the cuneate leaf's angle are better defined. A cuneate leaf may also be [[sagittate]].

